ros"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect2-id368" playOrder="448"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">使用特质与宏</text></navLabel><content src="ch22.html#using-traits-with-macros"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect2-id369" playOrder="449"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">范围界定与卫生问题</text></navLabel><content src="ch22.html#scoping-and-hygiene"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect2-id370" playOrder="450"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">导入和导出宏</text></navLabel><content src="ch22.html#importing-and-exporting-macros"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id371" playOrder="451"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">超越宏观规则！</text></navLabel><content src="ch22.html#beyond-macro_rules"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="chapter-id372" playOrder="452"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">23. 不安全的代码</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#unsafe-code"/><navPoint id="sect1-id373" playOrder="453"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">不安全是因为什么？</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#unsafe-from-what"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id374" playOrder="454"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">不安全的区块</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#unsafe-blocks"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id375" playOrder="455"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">示例：一种高效的 ASCII 字符串类型</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#example-an-efficient-ascii-string-type"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id376" playOrder="456"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">不安全的函数</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#unsafe-functions"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id569" playOrder="457"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">标记不安全代码</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#marking-unsafe-code"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id377" playOrder="458"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">未定义的行为</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#undefined-behavior"/></navPoint><navPoint id="sect1-id378" playOrder="459"><navLabel><text default-translate="no">不安全的特质</text></navLabel><content src="ch23.html#unsafe-t